00:13:32.812 --> 00:13:35.076
Worry about the mark instead of me.

00:13:35.581 --> 00:13:36.858
But...

00:13:36.882 --> 00:13:38.714
Who do you think I am?

00:13:39.285 --> 00:13:41.447
I'm the immortal Odaiba Shark.

00:13:43.923 --> 00:13:46.187
The Odaiba Shark never sleeps.

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:50.723
Detective Kudoh, I'm so glad he's okay, chu!

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:53.360
My heart was pounding so hard.

00:13:53.599 --> 00:13:56.569
My, my, you're both so involved.

00:13:56.702 --> 00:13:58.079
I'm home.

00:13:58.103 --> 00:13:59.581
Welcome back, Dear.

00:13:59.605 --> 00:14:03.718
Hey, Ran, I bought you a present to
