00:14:05.411 --> 00:14:06.936
What? A present?

00:14:07.079 --> 00:14:07.088
Ta-da!

00:14:07.112 --> 00:14:08.944
Run! Odaiba Cop Ta-da!

00:14:09.081 --> 00:14:11.345
Oh, an Odaiba Cop poster!

00:14:11.584 --> 00:14:15.111
Ran, become a great detective,
just like Detective Kudoh!

00:14:15.187 --> 00:14:17.485
Thank you, Father! I love you!

00:14:23.395 --> 00:14:25.454
Taizo is deeply moved!

