"what the heck is going on?"

00:15:14.246 --> 00:15:17.580
But I think Ran looks pretty good
as a detective too.

00:15:19.351 --> 00:15:20.462
This is a bad omen.

00:15:20.486 --> 00:15:23.148
| guess the rumor that you'd
quit being a gal was true.

00:15:23.289 --> 00:15:26.968
Well, it's more like she woke up to the
mission of the Kotobuki clan,

00:15:26.992 --> 00:15:28.960
rather than she quit being a gal.

00:15:31.997 --> 00:15:32.007
Q3INYM

00:15:32.031 --> 00:15:32.807
Q3ILNVM
What's this?

00:15:32.831 --> 00:15:34.442
Q3ILNVM
The perpetrator who raided those offices.

00:15:34.466 --> 00:15:36.244
Q3ILNVM
Ran said she saw him yesterday.

00:15:36.268 --> 00:15:37.702
Q3INYM

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:41.331
Damn it, if only I'd realized when
| bumped into him in the alley!

00:15:41.941 --> 00:15:44.019
Sis, it's a case, datchu!

00:15:44.043 --> 00:15:45.620
Another office has been raided!

00:15:45.644 --> 00:15:47.389
What did you say?!

00:15:47.413 --> 00:15:49.291
We rushed here when we got a call
from the security company

00:15:49.315 --> 00:15:50.992
that the anti-theft sensor had been triggered,

00:15:51.016 --> 00:15:52.627
but we arrived one step too late.

00:15:52.651 --> 00:15:56.798
Luckily, nothing was stolen, but who
would've thought he'd go after

00:15:56.822 --> 00:15:59.587
a private talent agency that doesn't
even have a sign out front.

00:16:00.726 --> 00:16:03.559
The culprit might be someone very
knowledgeable about Shibuya.

00:16:04.396 --> 00:16:06.341
He certainly doesn't think much of us.

00:16:06.365 --> 00:16:10.245
The great Super Cop Ran Kotobuki
knows what he looks like,

00:16:10.269 --> 00:16:12.237
and yet he boldly continues
to commit crimes!

00:16:12.504 --> 00:16:14.716
You better be prepared, Office Raider!

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:16.718
Just you watch!
I'll catch you no matter what!

00:16:16.742 --> 00:16:19.754
All right! It's for Ran-pyon and
the safety of Shibuyal

00:16:19.778 --> 00:16:21.246
I'll lend you a hand!

00:16:21.313 --> 00:16:23.024
Me tool

