What?!

00:18:01.313 --> 00:18:04.112
We've been looking everywhere for you,
Mr. Office Raider.

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:07.385
Now, give it up quietly and turn
yourself over to the law!

00:18:08.587 --> 00:18:09.297
Damn it!

00:18:09.321 --> 00:18:10.165
Hey, stop right there!
Damn it!

00:18:10.189 --> 00:18:11.088
Hey, stop right there!

00:18:12.191 --> 00:18:13.989
You're not getting away!

00:18:18.664 --> 00:18:20.175
Shoot! Ran, this way!

00:18:20.199 --> 00:18:21.276
Impertinent little bastard.

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:22.893
Stop!

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:27.239
Once I get on my bike, I'll be home free.

00:18:29.374 --> 00:18:31.138
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:18:31.276 --> 00:18:33.802
That's my bike! Get away from there!

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:36.705
So, it is yours, just as I thought.

00:18:37.382 --> 00:18:40.128
It's me. Remember? From the record shop?

00:18:40.152 --> 00:18:42.177
Oh, the guy who's always working there.

00:18:42.521 --> 00:18:45.300
There was something I wanted
to talk to you about,

00:18:45.324 --> 00:18:48.089
and I just happened to spot your bike,
so I was waiting for you.

00:18:48.627 --> 00:18:49.904
Talk?

00:18:49.928 --> 00:18:51.706
Sorry, but I don't have time to talk to you.

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:53.208
I'm in a bit of a hurry.

00:18:53.232 --> 00:18:55.200
Won't you join me for some tea
and a nice long chat?

00:18:55.767 --> 00:18:56.878
My treat.

00:18:56.902 --> 00:18:59.180
Hey, I said I was in a hurry!
Get out of my way!

00:18:59.204 --> 00:19:01.172
| see, that's too bad.

00:19:01.807 --> 00:19:03.639
| wanted to learn so much from you.

00:19:04.843 --> 00:19:07.904
Like the secret to
successfully raiding offices.

00:19:08.046 --> 00:19:09.810
What?!

00:19:10.182 --> 00:19:11.693
Why you...

00:19:11.717 --> 00:19:13.685
Hey! The Office Raider!

00:19:15.921 --> 00:19:18.266
You're not getting away now,
Office Raider!

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:20.258
Give it up for real this time!

00:19:20.959 --> 00:19:21.836
Damn it...

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:23.487
You little...

00:19:33.672 --> 00:19:36.985
