00:19:43.415 --> 00:19:45.747
Not at all, I only did what was right.

00:19:46.752 --> 00:19:48.763
I'd like to express my gratitude too.

00:19:48.787 --> 00:19:50.551
Thank you, Mr. Otohata.

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:53.735
You don't have to thank me or anything,

00:19:53.759 --> 00:19:55.727
just don't call me mister.

00:19:56.528 --> 00:20:00.487
Now, peace has once again returned
to the town of Shibuya!

00:20:05.771 --> 00:20:07.649
Good work, Ran!

00:20:07.673 --> 00:20:10.438
| am tremendously moved right now!

00:20:10.542 --> 00:20:12.320
