from Ran's mouth!

00:20:20.786 --> 00:20:24.065
In my thirty years as a police officer,
nothing has ever made me so happy!

00:20:24.089 --> 00:20:27.889
Oh, dear, the wonderful dinner is going
to be soaked with tears now.

00:20:28.093 --> 00:20:29.704
I've got renewed respect for you too.

00:20:29.728 --> 00:20:33.528
