a natural born police officer.

00:20:33.732 --> 00:20:36.929
Let's keep working hard to protect
the peace of Shibuya, datchu!

00:20:37.269 --> 00:20:38.279
<i>Of course!</i>

00:20:38.303 --> 00:20:40.465
The Super Cop will go on forever!

00:20:42.407 --> 00:20:44.569
